    {
      "id": "winter-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "1981 年冬天，熟悉的 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "location",
              "id": "lauras-room"
            },
            "label": "房间"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 已被木板、蓝图和机器结构占据。空间不再只是被观察的记忆，而像一套可以操作时间的装置。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "In winter 1981, the familiar "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "location",
              "id": "lauras-room"
            },
            "label": "room"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " is overtaken by boards, blueprints, and machinery. The space no longer behaves only as a remembered scene; it resembles a device for manipulating time."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "winter-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "这一章以 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "blue-cube"
            },
            "label": "蓝色方块"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 取代前三季反复出现的黑色方块，并通过照片上的时间把玩家重新指向春、夏、秋。叙事目标因此发生变化：不是继续向前，而是返回过去。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "This chapter replaces the recurring black cube with a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "blue-cube"
            },
            "label": "blue cube"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " and uses times attached to photographs to point back toward spring, summer, and fall. The narrative goal shifts from moving forward to returning to the past."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "winter-p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "蓝图把分散在房间里的装置组织成一套整体机制。到这里，"
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "memory"
            },
            "label": "记忆"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 不再只是需要逃离的场景，而成为可以被修改的因果链。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The blueprint organizes the room’s scattered devices into a single mechanism. At this point, "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "memory"
            },
            "label": "memory"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " is no longer only a place to escape from; it becomes a causal chain that can be altered."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
