            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Winter 1981 建立回到旧记忆的机制，并把故事导向“改变过去”。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Winter 1981 establishes a mechanism for revisiting earlier memories and redirects the story toward changing the past."
          }
        ]
      },
