      },
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "四季的顺序仍然保留，但从本章开始，阅读方向不再是单向的。Final 会沿着已建立的时间锚点返回早期记忆。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The seasonal order still matters, but from this chapter onward the reading direction is no longer one-way. Final returns through the time anchors already established."
          }
